# "Whenever you commit a crime, put a +1/+1 counter on Vadmir. This ability triggers only once each turn" (CR 700.13):
# on turn one Bot1 casts Vadmir, then three Shocks at Bot2 with Black Lotus mana: the first is a crime that triggers it (the
# stack holds Shock, the trigger, Shock, Shock), the other two don't, so it has one counter. A Shock a turn on turns three, five
# and seven makes two, three and four counters. "As long as Vadmir has four or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has menace and
# lifelink" (CR 122.1): at three (a 5/5) it has neither; at exactly four (a 6/6) both, and its attack gains its controller 6 life.

